| `.json` | 1 | Wilson (exactly 50.0%) |
| no extension | 1 | Wilson |

Whole-repo bus factor without the reformat correction is 2.

**Method**
- Copy detection used the default `git blame -w -M -C`. The tool flagged no author whose share moved by more than 2 points from it.
- Mechanical rewrites were checked across 139 commits. 62628c0 was set aside. Five others look mechanical but were kept:
  - 739dc11 "docs: reformat license" (Wilson, 17 lines)
  - fcd2b56 "issue #42: (WIP) switch to ESLint; clean up" (Troy, 16 lines)
  - 00d6eec "build: use yaml eslint configuration" (Wilson, 9 lines)
  - 344ce1e "build: <email redacted>" (Wilson, 1 line)
  - 9c2b59d "build: <email redacted>" (Wilson, 1 line)
- These figures show whose lines survive, not code quality, review work, or deliberately deleted code.

